Files in this directory are copied from imapkit 5.3.2 (https://github.com/postalsys/imapkit, dist/esm),
which is published under the MIT licence:

    mimeparser.js, bodystructure.js, envelope.js, addressparser.js and their .d.ts files

Each file carries imapkit's copyright holder and the full MIT licence text at the top.

mimeparser.js, addressparser.js and envelope.js (and the declarations that go with them) are modified by
Mailflare contributors: limits on nesting, part count, embedded message parsing and header field sizes.
bodystructure.js is unchanged apart from the notice.

Several comments name WildDuck (https://github.com/nodemailer/wildduck) as the origin of the algorithms.
imapkit's authors are the WildDuck authors and released imapkit under the MIT licence.

types.d.ts is Mailflare's own, a two-type excerpt of imapkit's so the declarations resolve without the package.
